# =============================================================================
# Digit Recognizer - .gitignore
# =============================================================================

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated data and models (NOT uploaded, they are rebuilt by the project code)
#   python fetch_mnist.py  -> downloads MNIST and caches models/mnist_data.joblib
#   python train_model.py  -> trains KNN + SVM and writes the rest of models/
# The KNN model alone is about 80 MB, close to GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
models/
*.joblib
*.pkl
*.pickle

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local datasets and archives that the code does not use
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
archive*/
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.7z

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Personal lab-report documents (remove these lines if you want them online)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.docx
*.doc
~$*
exp 9.pdf

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Personal study notes (for my own reading, not published)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
PROJECT_EXPLAINED.txt
PROJECT_EXPLAINED.html
digit recognition.html

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/
.env
.env.*
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editors, OS files and logs
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.log

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Intentionally KEPT in git (do not ignore):
#   static/images/     charts shown by the Detailed UI. accuracy_comparison.png and
#                      confusion_matrices.png are regenerated by train_model.py, but
#                      f1_comparison.png and sample_digits.png are not, so they are
#                      stored in the repo to keep every chart tab working.
#   docs/screenshots/  images used by README.md
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
